    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spook up homes to sell to ghosts as a <strong>Paranormal Realtor</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STAGE HOMES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621240/extras/a98d80d43ff6d7513ccec9dce87e7f49.poster.avif?t=1744397323\" width=680 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621240/extras/a98d80d43ff6d7513ccec9dce87e7f49.webm?t=1744397323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621240/extras/a98d80d43ff6d7513ccec9dce87e7f49.mp4?t=1744397323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and decorate homes to show off their spook potential! Choose from a wide variety of items from cheap tchotchkes to authentically creepy items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMPRESS CLIENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621240/extras/ab20220eddde553b5a899835280bc72f.poster.avif?t=1744397323\" width=680 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621240/extras/ab20220eddde553b5a899835280bc72f.webm?t=1744397323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621240/extras/ab20220eddde553b5a899835280bc72f.mp4?t=1744397323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highlight amenities and turn on the charm to land those sales!\u00a0Impress your ghostly clients when you throw your &quot;Open Haunt&quot;. Rooms react to your choices as you step up the scares.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE THE SALE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621240/extras/e3d5460ef793bb9c592e76f58c83bd23.poster.avif?t=1744397323\" width=680 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621240/extras/e3d5460ef793bb9c592e76f58c83bd23.webm?t=1744397323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621240/extras/e3d5460ef793bb9c592e76f58c83bd23.mp4?t=1744397323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghosts pay big bucks for high-spook homes! The more they're impressed, the more you get paid! Expand your real estate empire to more neighborhoods as you unlock new abilities, items, and clientele.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spook up homes to sell to ghosts as a <strong>Paranormal Realtor</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STAGE HOMES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621240/extras/a98d80d43ff6d7513ccec9dce87e7f49.poster.avif?t=1744397323\" width=680 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621240/extras/a98d80d43ff6d7513ccec9dce87e7f49.webm?t=1744397323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621240/extras/a98d80d43ff6d7513ccec9dce87e7f49.mp4?t=1744397323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and decorate homes to show off their spook potential! Choose from a wide variety of items from cheap tchotchkes to authentically creepy items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMPRESS CLIENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621240/extras/ab20220eddde553b5a899835280bc72f.poster.avif?t=1744397323\" width=680 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621240/extras/ab20220eddde553b5a899835280bc72f.webm?t=1744397323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621240/extras/ab20220eddde553b5a899835280bc72f.mp4?t=1744397323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highlight amenities and turn on the charm to land those sales!\u00a0Impress your ghostly clients when you throw your &quot;Open Haunt&quot;. Rooms react to your choices as you step up the scares.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE THE SALE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621240/extras/e3d5460ef793bb9c592e76f58c83bd23.poster.avif?t=1744397323\" width=680 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621240/extras/e3d5460ef793bb9c592e76f58c83bd23.webm?t=1744397323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621240/extras/e3d5460ef793bb9c592e76f58c83bd23.mp4?t=1744397323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghosts pay big bucks for high-spook homes! The more they're impressed, the more you get paid! Expand your real estate empire to more neighborhoods as you unlock new abilities, items, and clientele.</p>",
